# Privacy and tests
- Use synthetic/sanitized fixtures; real sensitive files require separate agreements, provider/data-use decision and founder authorization.
- Reversible tokenization is a PROPOSED security boundary, not automatic HIPAA de-identification; protected map and original-source quote reconciliation must be designed before use.
- Test relevant success and negative paths (unauthorized source, bad quote/page, prompt injection, unreadable pages, malformed model JSON, timeout, retry/replay and DB failure) in affected ticket.
- Support errors with safe codes, correlation IDs, stage and retryability. Never leak original quotes/PHI, tokens, secrets or model payloads in logs.
- Failure must not promote unchecked facts, change current accepted Study or erase reports. Bounded retries/timeouts, safe idempotency, no custom retry system without need.
- Report actual tests/commands; don't claim passing tests that were not run.
